    <briefdescription>
<para>keeps the buffers of <ref refid="classMR_1a23ac4b92c498002b16d1e14d3c27c802" kindref="member">fillContours2DPlan</ref> alive between calls (the sweep-line triangulation's own cache among them), so a caller preparing plans for many holes one by one avoids re-allocating them on every call; one cache must not be used by several threads at once Generated from class <computeroutput><ref refid="classMR_1_1IFillContours2DPlanCache" kindref="compound">MR.IFillContours2DPlanCache</ref></computeroutput>. This is the non-const half of the class. </para>
